        - Output: :math:`(N, C, D_{out}, H_{out}, W_{out})` or :math:`(C, D_{out}, H_{out}, W_{out})`, where

          .. math::
              D_{out} = \left\lfloor\frac{D_{in} + 2 \times \text{padding}[0] - \text{dilation}[0] \times
